msgstr ""

#: manual/api/query.md:221
msgid "The errors are `Unexpected end of query expression`, `Expected rparen`, `Unexpected trailing query tokens`, `Invalid query term`, `Missing query value`, `Invalid query value`, ``Unsupported query field `<name>` `` and `Unclosed quoted string`."
