#: manual/api/score.md:793
msgid "The second and third packages tie and share position 2 and label `B`; position 3 is skipped. The third package has no earlier signals and the fourth falls beyond the end of `past`, so both are `New`. The fourth has no signal at all and is `D` whatever its position."
